<description>&lt;p&gt;The United States signed a military cooperation agreement with Venezuela's interim government and a U.S. marine died after falling overboard during a Caribbean operation linked to the renewed ties. Former oil minister Machado called for a more drastic overhaul of the oil sector amid hyperinflation, food shortages, massive emigration and socioeconomic collapse. Grassroots groups rejected the agreement as a normalization of subordination while military prisoners entered a third week without food and families took the fight to court. The U.S. Senate panel is investigating JD Vance's ties to a prized Venezuelan oil contract, and UCDP counted 2 battle-related deaths in 2007.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxOYXVWZkRBUTJncGdxQ0JYd3ZqeWt2dUdMWWZ3bTBVUUtHV2FQeEU4c2Z5SGF1TXQyVDlYcnhNV0FBbDFhVlR1SXJobmtVd0ROaDRhTHpzNVExYWJYZVRBY3JiMnpGWFpVQWo2endfTFNHRldZal9vOEN1d0hVc1NhUFhjMmhJVmVkYUdPX2YtOVhiekZuSXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE51blBSY0VsOHlZOWlienNBYUpCRzNPMU9SaGxpZzlqX0ozT0pWSnNmeTY5RW95RDlrY3NZOFFtS05iN21QN2FPbzlNaE5YWmlLdnBzN2ZVckFzaEJpNWFmUEdLcG1oR2M?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFBkZ0diMS03M0p4bXVmSE9WVTRKRmtIUmxjS3hKandnMnEyWkd2MTdxbDRFbXZlT0Z1NW5OWm5ueHlCM0ZGdHh2cDM2c1JVNmozaE1aUWNNMGpOZk1z?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE5WWnRnQmRiN21LXy1ERk4wV0FVZmdodno5VFJ1LWtINXJHWktuV1RDd1owZzNTNWxRMmV3OE9XWERMMFp3dkZIcEVsczMzZzg?oc=5&quot;&gt;MTV Lebanon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxOb3RhSXBnUWRKUFhtNlhHUUE1aWpTLUk0U05Ndl9UNmYxTUtsTXpJZjJtREpFa2pPMEVuMHNuNGNkYXZHbXlVUHFrajNtN09Pa25hMnU1WTZOMkZITDU3eWp1aHNhYzNSVVRqMHdPeERlW